Nobara Kugisaki: orange-brown chin-length bob with side part, navy school jacket with small gold buttons and belt, navy skirt, dark brown stockings, brown loafers. Slim confident posture. A SMALL normal silver claw hammer with slender wooden handle in her right hand, NOT an axe or large sledgehammer; nails in her left hand. Normal attack 3-8: lift hammer, rotate shoulder, short diagonal hammer strike, crisp follow-through. Special 9-11: hold an upright iron nail in her left hand at chest height, aim toward right, tap nail with hammer, recover. Frame 15 holds a small straw doll in left hand and taps it with her right-hand hammer for Resonance. Hands remain anatomically distinct and nail not mistaken for finger. Guard hammer across torso, defeat kneeling without losing clothing.

