Eso (壊相): match official second reference EXACTLY. Tall muscular tan-skinned adult, shaved sides with a narrow dark upright mohawk tuft, white collar and small red bow tie, black studded suspender harness: horizontal chest band and vertical straps, white studded cuffs, dark high-waist fitted trousers, BARE FEET. No shirt, jacket, shoes, katana or gun. Angular stern face with forehead markings. More mature proportions around 5.5 heads, still the same pixel construction. Normal 3-8: sweeping open palm/claw strike with shoulder-led follow-through. Special 9-11: turn torso to expose back/shoulder and extend both arms to release blood feathers, keep body clear (engine supplies blood-wing effects). Frame 15 upright, one hand lowered and the other extended arrogantly. Do not invent extra limbs or generic monster wings in the sprite.

