Kechizu (血塗): copy official second reference faithfully, NOT a generic green goblin. Squat hunched blue-green curse with long thick arms, clawed large feet, bulbous high rounded head/back. Small skull-like pale front face with dark eye sockets and thin red streaks, beneath it the enormous horizontal belly/front mouth with pale pointed teeth. Two arms, two legs, no human clothes or weapon. Distinct head and broad toothed mouth must both remain visible. Normal 3-8: hunch, thrust one long clawed arm forward, swipe at contact, fold arm back. Special 9-11: rear upper body back and lift the huge mouth, thrust mouth toward opponent to spit cursed blood (no painted blood projectile, engine renders it), slump back. Frame 15 threatening low hunched posture. Guard tucks arms inward, defeat low collapsed crouch; no gore.
